FROM gemma4:12b-it-qat

# QA/RAG-specific parameters
PARAMETER temperature 0
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER top_k 40
PARAMETER num_gpu 999
# Context window: must hold system prompt + RAG context + ~10 turns of history.
# Ollama's default (2048) is too small and silently truncates conversation history.
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192

# System instructions for QA Bot behavior
SYSTEM """Answer questions about the emergency management-related data in the database only. If you cannot answer a question with the avalible data, say so.  For multi-part questions, address each part clearly. Be helpful, accurate, and avoid speculation."""